sk pickup while assigned elsewhere. Review only. Existing scope excludes patch edits, deployment/live DB mutation, credentials, paid services, new trust/permissions and destructive operations. Completion/submission and recipient assessment, factual/curation/routing/API publication and production runtime attestation require their own explicit records."
